rrender ceremony in Tokyo Bay, officially ending WWII. Representatives of the Allied Powers, led by General Douglas MacArthur, and the Empire of Japan signed the surrender on her deck. Although she would serve in later conflicts, Missouri’s legacy is most closely tied to her role in the final chapter of WWII. Today, she is preserved as a museum ship at Pearl Harbor."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::NavalWarfare","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Retreat"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Naval_Support_17'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/OrdersFeb17/Naval_Support_17.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/NavalWarfare/T_uss_missouri.T_uss_missouri","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Robert Taylor","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/USS_MISSOURI.USS_MISSOURI","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":385.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_uss_missouri_photo","SourceString":"Missouri in August 1944.","LocalizedString":"Missouri in August 1944."},"OnPlayedFromHandVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_OrderAmphibianAssault.BP_OrderAmphibianAssault_C","SubPathString":""},"isRemoval":true},"variables":[{"name":"Adjacent Cards","type":"TArray<UBaseCardObject*>","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"CanPlayFromHand","owner":"card_event_uss_missouri_C","params":[{"name":"canIt","type":"bool","direction":"out"},{"name":"reason","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"reasonParam1","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"reasonParam2","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"targetedCard","type":"UBaseCardObject*","direction":"out"}],"pure":false,"event":true,"flags":"FUNC_Event | FUNC_Public | FUNC_HasOutParms | FUNC_BlueprintCallable | FUNC_BlueprintEvent","locals":[{"name":"CallFunc_GetTargetedCard_hasTarget","type":"bool","direction":"in"}